 "result_text": "I added a \"Delete All\" button to the contents view. It deletes every object in the folder, not just the 1000 shown on the current page. I only checked that the module still imports; I haven't clicked the button in a running Zope or run the test suite.\n\n- **`BTreeFolder2.py`:** a new `manage_clean` method deletes all contained objects one by one. It is protected by the \"Delete objects\" permission. When called from the ZMI it re-renders the contents view afterwards.\n- **`contents.dtml`:** the button sits next to \"Delete\" and shows only to users with that permission. It asks for confirmation before submitting.\n\nThe method is called `manage_clean` because that was my best guess at the upstream name; I couldn't confirm it. If you want a different name, it's a one-line change in both files.\n\nDeleting a very large folder in one request may be slow or use a lot of memory, since it all happens in a single transaction.",
